                                                                                                                                                      approved by (i)&nbsp;the shareholders of the Company at the annual general meeting held on September&nbsp;13, 2025 with the exact
                                                                                                                                                      ratio to&#8239;be determined by the board of directors of the Company and (ii)&nbsp;the board of directors of the Company by way of written
                                                                                                                                                      board resolutions dated September&nbsp;20, 2025 to fix the share consolidation ratio at 1-for-30);</FONT></TD></TR></TABLE>

