    <TD STYLE="padding-right: 11.8pt"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">the amount of the increase in such net tangible book value per share attributable to the cash payments made by purchasers in the offering; and</FONT></TD></TR>
  </TABLE>
