<TD STYLE="white-space: nowrap; width: 10%; font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: right">65.0</TD>
<TD STYLE="white-space: nowrap; width: 1%; font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: left">%</TD>
<TD STYLE="white-space: nowrap; width: 2%; font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif">&nbsp;</TD>
<TD STYLE="white-space: nowrap; width: 1%; font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: left">&nbsp;</TD>
