<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">Our annual report on <FONT STYLE="color: blue"><A HREF="https://www.sec.gov/ix?doc=/Archives/edgar/data/1713539/000141057825000574/kxin-20241231x20f.htm" STYLE="-sec-extract: exhibit">Form&nbsp;20-F for the fiscal year ended December&nbsp;31, 2024 filed with the SEC on March&nbsp;31, 2025</A></FONT> contains a description of our business
and audited consolidated financial statements with a report by our independent auditors. These statements were prepared in accordance
with U.S. GAAP.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"></P>

<!-- Field: Page; Sequence: 42; Value: 1 -->
